      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} Not exactly worse in a technical way, but worse in impact for Deaf users.\n\nThe recent changes made chatbox timeouts and muting more aggressive, and because Deaf users rely on chatbox as our primary communication, it means we are cut off completely.\n\nFor non-mic users, chat is often a backup. For Deaf users, it is the only option. That difference is why this report needs to stay separate and explicit about accessibility.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
